Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 20:46:15 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 41/48] elden: media: sm8750 camss, sensor drivers, cci halt

split from 0001; i2c-cci keeps Armada's manual of_node_put cleanup
(elden's scoped-iterator variant not taken)
